{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Droned is a small project by a single dev to revive some old school action. Compete in AI league, take on the trials or battle it out in arena with your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game reward progression by collecting new drones, weapons &amp; utilities  that compliments your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI LEAGUE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ultimate drone team and take on AI-controlled squads based on real player loadouts. Climb the leaderboard and defend your rank in this solo competitive mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/6de7a8584aff9d45dbbbb6f88d3fcd7c.poster.avif?t=1753979823\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/6de7a8584aff9d45dbbbb6f88d3fcd7c.webm?t=1753979823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/6de7a8584aff9d45dbbbb6f88d3fcd7c.mp4?t=1753979823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRIALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high intense co-op mode\u2014a gauntlet of brutal combat scenarios designed to push your tactical mastery to the edge. Bring your best drone, a trusted ally, and a high-level Codex if you hope to survive. Do you have what it takes to conquer them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/41dc2fc72cd2867d6e86a3db4570e894.poster.avif?t=1753979823\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/41dc2fc72cd2867d6e86a3db4570e894.webm?t=1753979823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/41dc2fc72cd2867d6e86a3db4570e894.mp4?t=1753979823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARENA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in intense Deathmatch and Team Deathmatch modes against real players or bots in fast-paced, high-stakes combat. Victory goes to the last drone standing\u2014or the team with the sharpest tactics and deadliest aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/938e3c5e93a66f722fdcd323537746b0.poster.avif?t=1753979823\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/938e3c5e93a66f722fdcd323537746b0.webm?t=1753979823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/938e3c5e93a66f722fdcd323537746b0.mp4?t=1753979823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION AND LOADOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your drones with a growing collection of weapons &amp; utilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/e22b31210bd00b68c7e443d40f60b91a.poster.avif?t=1753979823\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/e22b31210bd00b68c7e443d40f60b91a.webm?t=1753979823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/extras/e22b31210bd00b68c7e443d40f60b91a.mp4?t=1753979823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"League Competitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1712720/162f96e7a08531a3deb7be0c89e7c78ff02d3db9.jpg"},{"name":"League Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1712720/4d289241d0ae0ccffbb552667b01da78867709ae.jpg"},{"name":"Arena Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1712720/ed5020eb1c64a23b2cb666a001a43ef663a0c344.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1712720?t=1753979823","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1712720?t=1753979823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/b5a7e139c57ba7c3e06d99e89592f313a2032e6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753979823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1712720/b5a7e139c57ba7c3e06d99e89592f313a2032e6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753979823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Droned is a small project by a single dev to revive some old school action. Compete in AI league, take on the trials or battle it out in arena with your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game reward progression by collecting new drones, weapons &amp; utilities  that compliments your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI LEAGUE</strong></